      "content": "i saw a video of myself today. someone had filmed me just walking to the grocery store and the comments... god. i dont even recognize that person anymore. everyone thinks i'm this monster, and the worst part is i can't even argue with them because the version of me that existed is just... gone. it feels like i'm already dead, just walking around in a ghost's body.",
